Sval: load Sval's lint rules for its component directory

The tree's flat configuration reads a directory's own .eslintrc.mjs only
when eslint-subdirs.config.mjs lists it. Listing browser/components/sval lets
Sval's added .eslintrc.mjs apply eslint-plugin-sval (tools/lint/eslint), so
mach lint runs Sval's test-hygiene rules with the rest; there is no other
hook into the configuration.

